    "details": "<p><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Details:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"position-relative\">\n<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live\">\n<ul>\n<li>\"Ethon\" is a two-round event encompassing 1st online round and 2nd offline round.</li>\n<li>A mandatory team of 2 people is required for participation.</li>\n<li>Participants will receive five themes (problem statements) for their PPT and must devise and implement their solutions, condensing their ideas into a maximum of 6 slides.</li>\n<li>In the first round, PPT submissions are to be emailed to the mail (by 3rd March 2027, 11:59PM).</li>\n<li>Qualifying teams will be invited for offline PPT presentations.</li>\n<li>Each presentation is limited to a maximum of 10 minutes.</li>\n<li>Evaluation criteria include:\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation</li>\n<li>Uniqueness</li>\n<li>Ease of Implementation</li>\n<li>Quality of The Presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
